---
/* Mission briefing: comic-p01-intro as horizontal scrollable strip */
---

<section class="mission-briefing">
  <div class="briefing-header">
    <h2>MISSION BRIEFING</h2>
    <p>Year 2194. The war ended. But the protocol remained. A reactivated infiltrator unit awakens to a human distress signal: <em>"…if anyone can hear this… we are still here…"</em></p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="comic-strip-scroll">
    <img 
      src="/assets/comic-p01-intro.webp" 
      alt="Comic: Year 2194, Iron Hunt protocol, DR4W unit inactive, distress signal, awakening sequence"
      data-pixelated
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
  
  <div class="briefing-promise">
    <p><strong>No math required.</strong> By the end you'll understand:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>What an LLM actually is (and isn't)</li>
      <li>How it gets turned into an agent that acts in the world</li>
      <li>The tooling around it (harnesses, rules, workflows, MCP)</li>
      <li>Why context, tokens, and temperature matter</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission-briefing {
    margin: 3rem 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--panel) 0%, rgba(34, 199, 176, 0.05) 100%);
    border: 2px dashed var(--signal);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  
  .briefing-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .briefing-header h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--signal);
  }
  
  .briefing-header p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .briefing-header em {
    color: var(--signal);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  
  .comic-strip-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }
  
  .comic-strip-scroll img {
    display: block;
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  
  .briefing-promise {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--signal);
  }
  
  .briefing-promise strong {
    color: var(--signal);
  }
  
  .briefing-promise ul {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .briefing-promise li {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mission-briefing {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }
    
    .briefing-header p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }
</style>
